From b192e4d9581fb17912fdf8326fc0a93b70175993 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <t@t>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 11:19:51 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Real GBA (JOY Bus) by default; mGBA features fold away; JOY
 Bus trace

- "Real GBA" is on by default and falls back to the integrated GBAs when no
  adapter has the JOY Bus firmware; such adapters keep working as GB-Links.
- The launcher puts the controller/mirror options, Save Files and Team sharing
  in a collapsible "mGBA emulation" section and opens at a 2:3 shape.
- Logs/JoyTrace.txt records every JOY Bus command and reply with emulated time,
  to design and check the netplay model offline.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01764cASb9aVVk2m6JupRMj5
